  "instance_name": "police_arrest_stereotype",
  "label": "Police Arrest Stereotype",
  "description": "The phrase 'the police just arrested it' implies that the chicken (metaphorically representing a Black person) was arrested for being black. This is a direct reference to the stereotype that Black people are more likely to be arrested or criminalized. This stereotype is rooted in systemic racism and is a key element of the meme’s hateful intent.",
